# Shell scripts must always be checked out with LF line endings.
# Bash refuses CRLF on `set -uo pipefail`, here-docs, and continuation
# backslashes, which broke smoke runs on Windows checkouts during
# v0.9.3 closeout. Apply globally so any future script under
# docs/scripts/ or VSAT/**/docs/scripts/ inherits the rule.
*.sh text eol=lf
